<div><p>Suita de teste pentru integrare</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc26014"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case Prj232-99: cgir3317_test_step1&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">cgir3317</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><pre>
Testam adaugarea unei parti, urmata de verificarea ca a fost adaugata partea.

</pre>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>Partea de test este validă.<br />
Avem o entitate de InventoryRepository validă.<br />
&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Se adauga o parte de test cu valorile&nbsp;(1, &quot;Test Part&quot;, 15.0, 10, 5, 20, 101);<br />
Se cauta partea de test cu numele &quot;Test Part&quot;</p>
</td><td><p><br />
Partea returnata nu va fi nula si va avea:<br />
Numele =&nbsp;&quot;Test Part&quot;<br />
Price = 15.0<br />
InStock =&nbsp;10</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3">0.50</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">cgir3317_F01:  AdaugarePiesa [Version : 1]<br />cgir3317_F02:  CautareElement [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
