<a name="toc_tc26017"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case Prj232-100: cgir3317_test_step2&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">cgir3317</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><pre>
Testăm adaugarea unui produs mockuit  prin repository, și verificăm dacă este returnat cu succes de service.

</pre>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>Entitatea InventoryRepository este validă.<br />
Entitatea InventoryService este validă si creată să folosească repositoriul creat.<br />
Produsul este un element mockuit care va fi alcătuit din 0 elemente, cu denumirea de &quot;Mock Product&quot;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Se adaugă prin repository produsul mockuit.<br />
Se cer prin service toate produsele.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Elementul mockuit se regăsește &icirc;n lista de produse&nbsp;returnate.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Se caută prin service produsul cu numele&nbsp;&quot;Mock Product&quot;</p>
</td><td><p>Elementul mockuit&nbsp;este identic cu cel returnat.&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3">1.00</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">cgir3317_F01:  AdaugarePiesa [Version : 1]<br />cgir3317_F02:  CautareElement [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
